      "type": "event",
      "date": "2025-11-22T07:10:00.000Z",
      "title": "Jai Corp Limited Announces Closure of Jaicorp Welfare Limited",
      "body": "Jai Corp. Limited announced at the board meeting held on November 22, 2025, Approved closure and liquidation of an un-listed, non-material wholly-owned subsidiary, Jaicorp Welfare Limited (Formerly known as Jaicorp Welfare Foundation) as that company is not carrying on any economic activity. Hence, there will be no material impact of the working of the Company and its subsidiaries. This will also help in streamlining the group structure by reducing the number of legal entities, reducing the multiplicity of legal and regulatory compliances required at present and rationalizing the cost by eliminating multiple record keeping and administrative functions.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "21",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "5eaade58-d325-4cd6-a74b-b7beb696e721",
      "type": "event",
      "date": "2025-11-22T07:10:00.000Z",
      "title": "Jai Corp Limited Appoints Amit Kumar Mundra as Member of the Audit Committee, the Corporate Social Responsibility Committee and the Business Responsibility and Sustainability Committee, Effective November 23, 2025",
      "body": "Jai Corp. Limited announced at the board meeting held on November 22, 2025, Appointed Mr. Amit Kumar Mundra (DIN: 01491934), an independent director, as a member of the Audit Committee, the Corporate Social Responsibility Committee and the Business Responsibility and Sustainability Committee of the Board of Directors with effect from 23-11-2025.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
