      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2025-11-15T20:27:02.000Z",
      "title": "Second quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.54 (vs ₹0.96 in 2Q 2025)",
      "body": "Second quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.54 (up from ₹0.96 in 2Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.66b (up 16% from 2Q 2025). Net income: ₹268.3m (up 56% from 2Q 2025). Profit margin: 16% (up from 12% in 2Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 77% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 2% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
